### Module 11 — API Test Requests
### Save as api_tests.http and use VS Code REST Client extension

@base_url = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@admin_user = admin
@admin_pass = adminpass123

### ── Posts ────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all posts
GET {{base_url}}/posts/
Accept: application/json

###

### Get a single post
GET {{base_url}}/posts/1/
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a new post (authenticated)
POST {{base_url}}/posts/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{admin_user}}:{{admin_pass}}

{
  "title": "My API Post",
  "body": "This post was created via the REST API.",
  "status": "published"
}

###

### Update a post
PATCH {{base_url}}/posts/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{admin_user}}:{{admin_pass}}

{
  "title": "Updated Title via PATCH"
}

###

### Delete a post
DELETE {{base_url}}/posts/1/
Authorization: Basic {{admin_user}}:{{admin_pass}}

###

### Get comments for a post (custom action)
GET {{base_url}}/posts/1/comments/
Accept: application/json
